    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TOWER DEFENCE WITH CARDS</h2>Use your cards to defend your town from the enemies. Collect new cards from the world with your heroes. Combine &amp; use cards to unlock new stuff and defence buildings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GO WILDERNESS, FIND NEW CARDS</h2>Send your heroes to wilderness to find new cards. Use them to craft &amp; upgrade your base.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND THE VILLAGE</h2>Defend your village from the danger of the night. Build defence towers &amp; traps. Heroes will hide inside the town during nights. Only way to protect them is using cards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888410/extras/61e60d785b8b1c46124b00ec9271b112.avif?t=1711128181\" width=616 height=100 /></span>",
